add('showkontrol_compose_show_copy','Returns warnings for explicit stopped cue nodes in the final edited timeline. Create a track or use existingPartName to target an existing timeline, then optionally add up to 100 cues, fixture-supported cue graphs, and an optional set-list entry in one new offline show copy. Use existingPartName alone, or trackName and partName with either templateName or templateDonor for a new track. Set entries are only supported for new tracks. Inspect the source and each donor first. A per-cue donor overrides the default; null leaves that cue without a graph. A mixedGraph overrides the default donor and cannot be combined with a per-cue donor. Mixed graph settings use nodeIndex; donor settings use nodeId. Optional audioClipEdits run in order after track selection and layer operations, before cues. Up to 100 edits select existing clips and attributes; new-track templates have no clips. Optional cueRemovals remove up to 100 existing cues in order before cue and graph edits and new cues. Graph-bearing cues require deleteGraph=true. Literal references in supported XML are checked; external and computed references remain unchecked. Optional cueEdits apply up to 100 ordered field edits to existing cues before adding cues. Optional graphSettingEdits apply up to 100 ordered existing graph setting edits after cueEdits and before new cues. New tracks contain no existing cues. Values and app acceptance are unverified. This does not author media. Destination filesystem must support hard links. Validate in ShowKontrol.',{source:z.string(),destination:z.string(),sha256:z.string().length(64),templateName:z.string().optional(),templateDonor:trackTemplateDonor.optional(),trackName:z.string().regex(/^[A-Za-z0-9 _-]*[A-Za-z0-9_-][A-Za-z0-9 _-]*$/).optional(),partName:z.string().regex(/^content\/[A-Za-z0-9_-]+\.sktl$/).optional(),existingPartName:z.string().min(1).optional(),layerOperations:layerOperationsSchema.optional(),audioClipEdits:audioClipEditsSchema.optional(),cueRemovals:composeCueRemovalsSchema.optional(),cueEdits:composeCueEditsSchema.optional(),graphSettingEdits:composeGraphSettingEditsSchema.optional(),cues:z.array(z.object({layer:z.number().int().nonnegative(),startMs:z.number().nonnegative(),lengthMs:z.number().positive(),label:z.string().min(1),donor:graphDonorSchema.nullable().optional(),mixedGraph:mixedGraphSchema.optional(),settings:z.array(z.union([z.object({nodeId:z.string().min(1),key:z.string().min(1),value:z.string()}),z.object({nodeIndex:z.number().int().nonnegative(),key:z.string().min(1),value:z.string()})])).optional(),patchSettings:z.array(patchSettingSchema).optional(),postPatchSettings:z.array(z.union([z.object({nodeId:z.string().min(1),key:z.string().min(1),value:z.string()}),z.object({nodeIndex:z.number().int().nonnegative(),key:z.string().min(1),value:z.string()})])).optional()})).max(100).optional(),donor:graphDonorSchema.optional(),set:z.object({name:z.string(),setName:z.string().min(1),createIfMissing:z.boolean().optional()}).optional()},composeShowCopy,{readOnlyHint:false,destructiveHint:false,idempotentHint:false,openWorldHint:false});
